abstract: "A Model Context Protocol server that lets AI assistants query how States voted at the UN Commission on Human Rights, the Human Rights Council and the General Assembly's Third Committee, from an offline snapshot of the HRC Voting dataset, with the dataset's methodological safeguards built in."
